  "solution": "Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>40</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>40</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lý sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>40</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>40</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Độ cao của tòa nhà là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
